metabolism, inflammation,

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.100
DNA damage, and the aging process.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.560
She has published landmark review articles

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.060
and primary research,

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.200
meaning original research articles,

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.930
