00:40:18.133 --> 00:40:19.490
- This is amazing.

00:40:19.490 --> 00:40:22.120
For people, so these
are prescription drugs

00:40:22.120 --> 00:40:25.510
that are essentially very
high-potency, purified omega-3s,

00:40:25.510 --> 00:40:27.910
but they're given to
people for lipid issues.

00:40:27.910 --> 00:40:31.100
So this is the treatment of
issues with fat metabolism

00:40:31.100 --> 00:40:32.380
by giving people fat.

