00:40:33.522 --> 00:40:35.210
- I just want to push home,

00:40:35.210 --> 00:40:37.500
again, I'm not carnivore keto
or anything, I'm an omnivore,

00:40:37.500 --> 00:40:42.500
but to just push home that
one thing that's so wonderful

00:40:42.780 --> 00:40:44.870
that you've done over the
years and you continue to do

