00:43:47.377 --> 00:43:49.210
"if you want this relationship to work."

00:43:49.210 --> 00:43:50.940
And so it was eight
hours of feeding window,

00:43:50.940 --> 00:43:53.580
plus some measurements and
time to walk into the lab,

00:43:53.580 --> 00:43:54.780
