00:57:33.670 --> 00:57:35.440
We all know smoking is bad for us

00:57:35.440 --> 00:57:37.696
and will take years off
our life expectancy.

00:57:37.696 --> 00:57:38.529
- [Andrew] Absolutely.

00:57:38.529 --> 00:57:40.420
- But smokers that had the high level,

00:57:40.420 --> 00:57:42.930
like smokers that were taking
their fish oil or eating fish

00:57:42.930 --> 00:57:45.720
or whatever it was they were
doing to get them up to 8%,

00:57:45.720 --> 00:57:48.530
they had the same life
expectancy as non-smokers

00:57:48.530 --> 00:57:50.478
with the low Omega-3 Index.

00:57:50.478 --> 00:57:51.311
- [Andrew] Wow.

00:57:51.311 --> 00:57:53.102
- Right?
- Wow.

00:57:53.102 --> 00:57:55.840
