00:58:54.490 --> 00:58:57.220
they are resolving inflammation.

00:58:57.220 --> 00:58:58.920
They're blunting inflammation.

00:58:58.920 --> 00:59:01.223
They're doing so many different.

00:59:02.450 --> 00:59:03.950
They affect so many different parts

00:59:03.950 --> 00:59:05.060
of the inflammatory pathway,

00:59:05.060 --> 00:59:08.960
which is, I think, plays a
huge role in the way we age,

00:59:08.960 --> 00:59:10.400
the way our brain ages, the way we feel,

00:59:10.400 --> 00:59:12.870
our mood, our joints, all that.

00:59:12.870 --> 00:59:17.111
And so it's amazing
that it's not, you know.

00:59:17.111 --> 00:59:19.740
- I love fish oil. I feel
