01:04:16.870 --> 01:04:19.020
Glen is a very conservative guy,

01:04:19.020 --> 01:04:22.090
but they've done this stuff
now in pigs, in rodent models,

01:04:22.090 --> 01:04:23.780
and now also two studies in humans.

01:04:23.780 --> 01:04:25.683
It's looking pretty interesting.

01:04:26.600 --> 01:04:30.023
