01:49:22.970 --> 01:49:24.010
and I really like it.

01:49:24.010 --> 01:49:25.900
But I thought the
magnesium threonate stuff

01:49:25.900 --> 01:49:27.460
was super interesting.

01:49:27.460 --> 01:49:29.460
I would love to see more
clinical data as well,

01:49:29.460 --> 01:49:31.940
but I think, once we get
it, it'll probably be like,

01:49:31.940 --> 01:49:33.750
oh yeah, it's getting into
the brain, and it's awesome,

01:49:33.750 --> 01:49:35.053
so, you know, why wait?

01:49:36.182 --> 01:49:37.370
- And along those lines,

01:49:37.370 --> 01:49:40.520
I once put out a post that said,

01:49:40.520 --> 01:49:42.320
I feel like there are a
number of different categories

01:49:42.320 --> 01:49:45.550
of health information consumers online

01:49:45.550 --> 01:49:48.130
and understanding which one
you're in for which topic

01:49:48.130 --> 01:49:49.890
can alleviate a lot of
the strain and stress

01:49:49.890 --> 01:49:50.890
of finding the information.

01:49:50.890 --> 01:49:52.940
There's some people that
are perfectly comfortable

01:49:52.940 --> 01:49:54.100
with data from a mouse study.

01:49:54.100 --> 01:49:56.380
It's like, "If it's done in
mice, great. I'll try it."

01:49:56.380 --> 01:49:59.180
Other people say, "No, it
has to be done in humans."

01:49:59.180 --> 01:50:01.330
Double-blind, placebo-controlled studies.

01:50:01.330 --> 01:50:04.040
Randomized clinical trials, et cetera.

01:50:04.040 --> 01:50:05.557
Then, other people just
say, "You know what?

01:50:05.557 --> 01:50:06.777
"I don't even care about any of that.

01:50:06.777 --> 01:50:08.500
"Just tell me what you do."

01:50:08.500 --> 01:50:09.527
And then, other people
say, "You know what?

01:50:09.527 --> 01:50:12.050
"I don't even care what you
do. Just tell me what to do."

01:50:12.050 --> 01:50:13.720
And then, there's this other category

01:50:13.720 --> 01:50:15.690
which are, if it's in
pill form or powder form,

01:50:15.690 --> 01:50:16.620
they'll take it.

01:50:16.620 --> 01:50:18.410
And so I think a lot of the battles

01:50:18.410 --> 01:50:20.960
of people picking apart
people's posts and things

01:50:20.960 --> 01:50:23.510
have to do with the fact
that people don't realize

01:50:23.510 --> 01:50:26.670
that people are showing up to the table

01:50:26.670 --> 01:50:29.920
