of those stances.

01:50:29.920 --> 01:50:31.380
We know people that will try anything,

01:50:31.380 --> 01:50:33.220
and we know people that
won't take anything.

01:50:33.220 --> 01:50:38.220
So the idea here is to create
an array of possibilities

01:50:38.270 --> 01:50:41.860
for people, and I think the
animal data are very impressive.

01:50:41.860 --> 01:50:42.980
We should have you back on to talk-

01:50:42.980 --> 01:50:44.330
- I take it with the hope of,

01:50:44.330 --> 01:50:45.820
