intermittent challenge,

01:51:02.210 --> 01:51:03.070
which I love.

01:51:03.070 --> 01:51:08.050
I think, intermittent
fasting, cold, heat, exercise,

01:51:08.050 --> 01:51:10.040
I mean, maybe even
