02:06:40.400 --> 02:06:43.370
- There was a brilliant study by,

02:06:43.370 --> 02:06:45.880
at the time, he was a
postdoc, Matthew Robinson,

02:06:45.880 --> 02:06:49.860
and he's now gone on to start his own lab

02:06:49.860 --> 02:06:53.490
at the University of Oregon
Health Science Center.

02:06:53.490 --> 02:06:55.530
- [Andrew] Great place, yeah.

02:06:55.530 --> 02:07:00.530
- And he did a study where
both young and older people,

02:07:00.810 --> 02:07:02.440
they had this whole
high-intensity protocol,

02:07:02.440 --> 02:07:03.750
which I can't remember what it was,

02:07:03.750 --> 02:07:07.090
but their protocol for X amount of time.

02:07:07.090 --> 02:07:08.933
