02:39:33.450 --> 02:39:35.440
Eric Kandel, Nobel Prize
winner at Columbia,

02:39:35.440 --> 02:39:37.350
comes to mind for all his work on memory,

02:39:37.350 --> 02:39:39.300
used to swim a mile a day,

02:39:39.300 --> 02:39:41.280
and now I think swims half a mile a day,

02:39:41.280 --> 02:39:44.560
