02:39:44.560 --> 02:39:45.870
which is incredible.

02:39:45.870 --> 02:39:47.490
And his lab has done some work showing

02:39:47.490 --> 02:39:51.400
that any load-bearing exercise
repeated, so endurance work,

02:39:51.400 --> 02:39:53.700
unlike the Peloton or cycling,
that's really load-bearing,

02:39:53.700 --> 02:39:55.770
although you're cycling really
