02:39:55.770 --> 02:40:00.770
but causes the release of
osteocalcin from the bones,

02:40:01.050 --> 02:40:04.320
which acts in an endocrine
way, sort of like a hormone,

02:40:04.320 --> 02:40:06.370
can actually travel to the hippocampus

02:40:06.370 --> 02:40:08.550
and, at least in these animal studies,

02:40:08.550 --> 02:40:11.980
induce the proliferation of
neurons, growth of synapses,

02:40:11.980 --> 02:40:13.650
BDNF, a number of downstream things,

02:40:13.650 --> 02:40:15.340
which kind of makes sense,

02:40:15.340 --> 02:40:18.610
